# TypeScript

- Do not use the `any` type. Use `unknown` or a real type.
- No `console.log` in committed code; use `logger.debug`.
- Name files in kebab-case, for example `build-status.ts`.
- Prefer interfaces for public object shapes.
- Export one main thing per file.
